  "$comment": "Ground truth for the zod pack (docs/packs.md, \"Ground truth\"). Each public repository is pinned at the commit before its own zod 3 to 4 upgrade. Expected findings come from two sources that are not Uptide, drafted by pnpm packs:truth and read by hand: the diagnostics the repository's TypeScript reports with zod 4.6.5 linked in and not without it (errors, and deprecations 6385/6387), and the lines the upgrade commit changed for zod (one site per construct; comments and other packages' changes left out). Rules are assigned from each site's code and text. The storefront fixture is synthetic: scored, never counted toward verified; its breaking sites are the tsc errors of fixtures/truth/storefront.json."
